# --- credentials: never commit -------------------------------------------
# Every .env variant, at any depth. The rules above covered `.env`,
# `.env.local` and `.env.*.local` but not `functions/.env.access-pafos` - which
# is exactly how the Firebase CLI stores per-project configuration, live keys
# included. One unmatched pattern is all it takes.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

secrets/
!secrets/README.md
service-account*.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
*.pem
*.p12
_to_delete/
